sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-031: Private Team Chat — Sequence Diagram
    actor PART as Confirmed PART
    participant UI as React TeamChatView
    participant GUARD as Auth + Membership Guards
    participant API as Express Team Chat API
    participant SERVICE as Chat Service / Privacy Projection
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / Supabase

    PART->>UI: Open team chat
    UI->>UI: Show loading and clear stale team content
    par Open linked channel
        UI->>GUARD: GET /api/teams/:teamId/chat
    and Load message history
        UI->>GUARD: GET /api/teams/:teamId/chat/messages
    end
    GUARD->>GUARD: Verify Firebase auth, MFA, active verified PART
    GUARD->>DB: Query Confirmed memberships for participant
    alt Visitor, restricted account, ADMIN, or non-member
        DB-->>GUARD: No eligible Confirmed membership
        GUARD-->>UI: 401 or generic 403 with no-store response
        UI->>UI: Clear channel/messages and show access denied
    else Confirmed member of route team
        DB-->>GUARD: Target team membership confirmed
        GUARD->>API: Continue protected request
        API->>SERVICE: Open channel or list messages by team
        SERVICE->>DB: Resolve persisted channel by team_id
        DB-->>SERVICE: channel_type=team and matching team_id
        opt Message-list request
            SERVICE->>DB: Query chronological channel messages
            DB-->>SERVICE: Messages or empty array
        end
        SERVICE->>SERVICE: Resolve handles and scrub private fields
        SERVICE-->>UI: Safe channel/messages response
        UI-->>PART: Show channel, empty state, or message thread
    end

    PART->>UI: Submit message draft
    UI->>UI: Validate nonblank body and 4,000-character limit
    alt Client validation fails
        UI-->>PART: Show field error and keep exact draft
    else Client validation passes
        UI->>GUARD: POST /api/teams/:teamId/chat/messages
        GUARD->>DB: Recheck current Confirmed membership
        alt Authorization no longer valid
            GUARD-->>UI: Generic 401/403 without private content
            UI->>UI: Clear private content and keep unsent draft
        else Authorized
            GUARD->>API: Continue with validated request body
            API->>SERVICE: Send message for persisted team channel
            SERVICE->>DB: Insert chat_messages row
            DB->>DB: Trigger rechecks team lifecycle, membership, suspension
            alt Invalid body, read-only team, or storage failure
                DB-->>SERVICE: Safe validation/lifecycle failure
                SERVICE-->>UI: Error response
                UI-->>PART: Show error and keep exact draft
            else Message persisted
                DB-->>SERVICE: Created message
                SERVICE->>SERVICE: Return handle, timestamp, and body only
                SERVICE-->>UI: 201 safe message response
                UI->>UI: Append message and clear draft
                UI-->>PART: Show Message sent
            end
        end
    end

